title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg
go-to: main_rally; sa_disrupt if sa_strength > 180 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@sa_disrupt

The Nazi SA has disrupted our rally! Their street troops are preventing us from meeting.

- @rfb_protect: Use the Reichsbanner to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.


@rfb_protect
on-arrival: rfb_success = rfb_strength*rfb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rfb_protect_win if rb_success >= 0; rfb_protect_lose if rfb_success < 0

@rfb_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Rotfrontkämpferbund has successfully protected our rally against the SA! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@rfb_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_nsdap += 3; rb_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the Rotfrontkämpferbund was not able to hold back the SA mob. The Nazis have won this show of strength.

@cancel
on-arrival: workers_nsdap += 3;

The SA have won this show of strength.

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of political life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @class_struggle: The class struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
- @women: The struggle also expands to women, their liberation is linked with the proletariat's. 
- @no_austerity: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against dictatorship and fascism.
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @anti_fascist: We must adress the rapid rise of fascism!
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if left_strength > reformist_strength; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; old_middle_spd -= 3; new_middle_spd -= 2;

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while potentially alienating the middle class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]

@women
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent) if women_connection >= 3; unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent) ; unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent) if women_connection >= 3

We give speeches supporting feminist causes, carefully adjusting our rhetoric to be appealing to women. [? if women_connection > 3 : The increased number of women in our leadership and propaganda have bolstered their support for us. ?]

@no_austerity
view-if: welfare <=0
on-arrival:  unemployed_kpd += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed_z -= 2 if z_in_government; unemployed_ddp -= 2 if ddp_in_government; unemployed_spd -= 2 if spd_in_government; unemployed_dvp -= 2 if dvp_in_government; unemployed_dnvp -= 2 if dnvp_in_government

Our speakers harshly criticise the government's austerity and its dealing of the crises.

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

Our speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War. The pacifist messaging also attracts women.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@anti_fascist
view-if: nsdap_r >=20
unavailable-subtitle: Thankfully, the Nazi threat is over for the time being.
on-arrival: nazi_urgency += 1; workers_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent); rural_nsdap += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_nsdap -= 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd -= 2*(1-dissent); catholics_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent)

We rally hard against the Nazis, attacking them as violet thugs for capitalists.


@local
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_kpd += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent)

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
